{
  "uid": "kwaba-bench",
  "title": "kwaba - benchmark Wi-Fi",
  "tags": [
    "kwaba",
    "wifi",
    "iperf3"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "5m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "label": "Source",
        "current": {}
      },
      {
        "name": "site",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Site",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(kwaba_bench_tcp_mbps, site)",
          "refId": "site"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "current": {}
      },
      {
        "name": "mode",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Mode",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(kwaba_bench_tcp_mbps{site=\"$site\"}, mode)",
          "refId": "mode"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "current": {}
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Dernière mesure il y a",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "time() - max(kwaba_bench_mesure_timestamp_seconds{site=\"$site\",mode=\"$mode\"})",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 90000
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 180000
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "description": "Âge de la mesure la plus récente du site et du mode choisis. Étoile : un passage par heure (heures bench_etoile_heures) ; matrice : toutes les 4 h (bench_matrice_heures). Orange au-delà de 25 h, rouge au-delà de 50 h."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Paires mesurées",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(kwaba_bench_mesure_timestamp_seconds{site=\"$site\",mode=\"$mode\"})",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "description": "Nombre de paires (de → vers) connues. CDI : étoile 8 (chaque satellite vers le routeur), matrice 72 (chaque borne vers les 8 autres)."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Paires en erreur",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(kwaba_bench_erreur{site=\"$site\",mode=\"$mode\"}) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "description": "Paires dont au moins un test a échoué ou a été sauté (fin du créneau, borne injoignable, serveur occupé). Doit rester à 0."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Lecture",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Lecture** : ligne = borne qui lance le test (**de**), colonne = borne testée (**vers**). **aller** : de → vers ; **retour** : vers → de.\n\n**etoile** : chaque satellite ↔ routeur, toutes les heures libres ; **matrice** : chaque borne vers toutes les autres, toutes les 4 h. Un seul test à la fois sur le site. Case noire « — » : pas de mesure. Survoler le **i** d'un panneau pour le détail. Doc : docs/benchmark.md (kwaba-wifi)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "TCP aller (Mbit/s)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "kwaba_bench_tcp_mbps{site=\"$site\",mode=\"$mode\",sens=\"aller\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "groupingToMatrix",
          "options": {
            "columnField": "vers",
            "rowField": "de",
            "valueField": "Value",
            "emptyValue": "null"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "align": "center",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "color-background",
              "mode": "basic"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 150
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null+nan",
                "result": {
                  "text": "—",
                  "color": "#000000",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "empty",
                "result": {
                  "text": "—",
                  "color": "#000000",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "de\\vers"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "auto"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "de \\ vers"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "description": "Débit TCP de la borne en ligne (de) vers la borne en colonne (vers), en Mbit/s. Repères CDI : câble ↔ câble 600 à 930, liaisons en mesh 200 à 330. Rouge < 50, orange < 150. Case noire « — » : pas de mesure (la borne elle-même, ou paire pas encore mesurée)."
    },
    {
